  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd the missing Gate map to the DXF profile MCP suite.\nMap the suite to app::mcp, app::tool_profile_dxf, and app::commands.\nAdd a pin for quick suite selection from each module.\n\n## Cause\n\nPR #2100 added the suite without a Gate map header.\nThe xtask header check fails on upstream/main c605e5687.\nThe quick planner also omits the suite when its app modules change.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pin: gate_maps_tests::tool_dxf_profile_mcp_is_selected_for_its_app_entry_points.\n- The pin failed before the header change and passed after it.\n- Mutation: copy the upstream header back. The pin fails. Restore the fixed header. The pin passes.\n- cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main passed both steps.\n- The DXF MCP integration test and all 157 xtask tests passed.\n- cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The .nc and .cl diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe batch and release gates did not run.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone found in open PRs for the changed files.\n\nEffort: low\n\nProcess change: yes\n\nChangelog: Restore the DXF profile MCP suite Gate map and pin quick suite selection.\n\nFixes #2411\n",
